      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"ReactiveIsNewAwareAuditingHandler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.auditing\"><code>ReactiveIsNewAwareAuditingHandler</code></a> for the given <a href=\"../mapping/context/PersistentEntities.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>PersistentEntities</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定的 <a href=\"../mapping/context/PersistentEntities.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>PersistentEntities</code></a> 创建一个新的 <a href=\"ReactiveIsNewAwareAuditingHandler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.auditing\"><code>ReactiveIsNewAwareAuditingHandler</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
