    {
      "source": "Factory method that creates a new <a href=\"ReactiveIsNewAwareAuditingHandler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.auditing\"><code>ReactiveIsNewAwareAuditingHandler</code></a> for the given <a href=\"../mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "用于为给定的<a href=\"../mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping.context 中的接口\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>创建新的<a href=\"ReactiveIsNewAwareAuditingHandler.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.auditing 中的类\"><code>ReactiveIsNewAwareAuditingHandler</code></a>的工厂方法。",
      "count": 3
